fixture dash_buffer_cooldown_edges
doc Task 3 review round 2 (an edge it pinned): BUILD.md s5 Dash "Cooldown 24 f on ground"; s5 feel rules "Buffers are generous (8 f)". A press 9 frames before the cooldown ends has expired; one 8 frames before fires on frame 24.
room test/flat
frames 80
input
  0 dash
  15 dash
  30 dash
  46 dash
end
expect
  at 0 event.dash=1
  never 1..29 event.dash=1
  at 30 event.dash=1
  # 30 + 24 = 54: the press on 46 (8 frames earlier) fires there.
  never 31..53 event.dash=1
  at 54 event.dash=1
end
